                                        "entry_id": "a1c4bc9b-77ec-3e7a-8c7f-4015bb17ed40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inability to perform; lack of competence; ineptitude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7f77d79-a925-484e-8f07-f0ff5bc90ffa",
                                                "sense_id": "5e2e5c53-0f32-34dc-a307-c85312c06b5a",
                                                "text": "... at the head of a crew, too, chiefly made up of mongrel renegades, and castaways, and cannibals--morally enfeebled also, by the incompetence of mere unaided virtue or right-mindedness in Starbuck"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "385e0352-ebbf-4b20-9739-c967ac365621",
                                                "sense_id": "5e2e5c53-0f32-34dc-a307-c85312c06b5a",
                                                "text": "Winston did not know why Withers had been disgraced. Perhaps it was for corruption or incompetence. Perhaps Big Brother was merely getting rid of a too-popular subordinate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b0bb71f-3ee4-46fc-81ec-2b24a3e7e719",
                                                "sense_id": "5e2e5c53-0f32-34dc-a307-c85312c06b5a",
                                                "text": "The factory where she worked was a poisonous mass of incompetence, favoritism, and sabotage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
